      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm\nClicking Clear Cache and restarting leads me to 0% loading bug, I waited on this long enough for vrc to give up and try to send me home (which also got stuck at 0%).\nClosing vrc and reopening allowed VRC to load into my home world, but  I found the cache was still ~20Gb. (I've since manually cleared it).\nSo far I've not seen the 0% bug myself outside of trying to clear my cache",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
