      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same here.  I had no issues prior to current update.  Now clearing advanced cache no longer appears to work.  Exiting and restarting VRChat shows same amount of cache.  Also starting VRChat gets stuck on loading screen at 0% until forced to exit and restart which makes it work.  Exiting VRChat also does not exit gracefully.  Should I be waiting longer for it to exit?  Maybe it is trying to delete the cache? I will try to wait longer next time like for a few minutes.\nI've had to manually delete the files in the appdata locallow cache-windowsplayer folder to clear my cache.  I'm not using any mods. Using Oculus library app launch, Oculus Rift CV1.\nI wonder if an uninstall, delete VRChat folder to wipe any trace files, and reinstall might help?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
